# x6100_trx messages (MSG key): M1-M8
#
#   msg <1-8> cw <text>        CW, in CW / CW-R mode: A-Z 0-9 / ? . , = + -, keyer speed
#   msg <1-8> voice <file>     a WAV file in /etc/x6100/voice (48 kHz, 16 bit, mono or
#                              stereo), in LSB / USB / AM / NFM
#   msgrepeat <s>              MSG long: send again after this many seconds (1-600)
#
# Edit here or from the console (msg, msgrepeat); x6100_trx rewrites this file.

msgrepeat 10
msg 1 cw CQ CQ DE NOCALL NOCALL K
msg 2 cw TU 5NN
msg 3 cw 73 DE NOCALL SK
